{"events": [{"tStartMs": 80, "dDurationMs": 3600, "segs": [{"utf8": "This is the best recipe on earth for making\ncheap beef taste expensive."}]}, {"tStartMs": 10080, "dDurationMs": 2720, "segs": [{"utf8": "Because beef bourguignon is traditionally\nmade with chuck,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 12800, "dDurationMs": 3320, "segs": [{"utf8": "one of the least expensive cuts of beef,\nyou need to make sure to treat it right."}]}, {"tStartMs": 16120, "dDurationMs": 1520, "segs": [{"utf8": "And the first step is: marinating it."}]}, {"tStartMs": 17680, "dDurationMs": 3360, "segs": [{"utf8": "What I love so much about this dish is that\nit was a peasant dish in France,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 21040, "dDurationMs": 3000, "segs": [{"utf8": "meaning that it was designed to take a cut\nof beef that nobody really wanted,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 24040, "dDurationMs": 1880, "segs": [{"utf8": "and make it taste really, really good."}]}, {"tStartMs": 25920, "dDurationMs": 2520, "segs": [{"utf8": "The marinade is pretty simple,\nand uses chopped onions,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 28480, "dDurationMs": 2480, "segs": [{"utf8": "a few smashed cloves of garlic,\nsome chopped carrots,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 31000, "dDurationMs": 2693, "segs": [{"utf8": "a \"bouquet garni\", which is\na French way to tie up herbs,"}]}, {"tStartMs": 33717, "dDurationMs": 2063, "segs": [{"utf8": "all covered up in a whole bottle\nof red wine."}]}, {"tStartMs": 35780, "dDurationMs": 3820, "segs": [{"utf8": "This wine will tenderize and flavor\nthe beef as it sits in the fridge overnight."}]}, {"tStartMs": 39600, "dDurationMs": 2448, "segs": [{"utf8": "Once that beef is marinated,\nwe'll remove it from the mixture"}]}, {"tStartMs": 42072, "dDurationMs": 1008, "segs": [{"utf8": "and set it off to the side."}]}, {"tStartMs": 43080, "dDurationMs": 3400, "segs": [{"utf8": "And then I'll also fish out all those\nvegetables to separate them from the red wine."}]}]}